{"muh":[{"id":"muh","headword":"मुह्","headword_slp1":"muh","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. मुह् cl. 4. P. (Dhātup. xxvi, 89) मु॑ह्यति (rarely Ā. ˚ते; pf. मुमोह, Br. &c. ; मुमुहे, MBh.; aor. अमुहत्, Br.; fut. मोहिता, मोग्धा, मोढा Gr.; मोहिष्य॑ति, Br.; मोक्ष्यति Gr.; inf. मुहे॑, RV.; ind.p. मोहित्वा, मुहित्वा; मुग्ध्वा, मूढ्वा Gr.; -मो॑हम् Gr.),\nto become stupefied or unconscious, be bewildered or perplexed, err, be mistaken, go astray, RV. &c., &c.;\nto become confused, fail, miscarry (opp. to √ कॢप्), ŚBr. &c. &c.:\nCaus. मोहयति (mc. also ˚ते; aor., अमूमुहत्; Pass., मोह्यते),\nto stupefy, bewilder, confound, perplex, cause to err or fail, RV. &c. &c.;\n (Ā., with अध्वानम्) to cause to go the wrong way, MBh. :\nDesid. मुमोहिषति, मुमुहिषति, मुमुक्षति Gr.:\nIntens. मोमुह्यते (MBh.), मोमोग्धि and मोमोढि (Gr.), to be greatly bewildered or perplexed."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. मुह् (nom. मुक् or मुट्, Pāṇ. viii, 2, 33, Sch.) See मनो-मु॑ह्."}]}]}],"muhira":[{"id":"muhira","headword":"मुहिर","headword_slp1":"muhira","senses_r":[{"n":1,"pos":"m.","spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"a fool, blockhead, L. (cf. मुहेर)"}]},{"n":2,"pos":"m.","spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"‘bewilderer’, N. of the god of love, L."}]}]}],"muhu":[{"id":"muhu","headword":"मुहु","headword_slp1":"muhu","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"or मुहु॑, ind. suddenly, in a moment, RV.; ŚBr."}]}]}],"muhuH":[{"id":"muhuH","headword":"मुहुः","headword_slp1":"muhuH","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"in comp. = मुहुर्."}]}]}],"muhuHprokta":[{"id":"muhuHprokta","headword":"मुहुःप्रोक्त","headword_slp1":"muhuHprokta","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मुहुः—प्रोक्त mfn. often told, L."}]}]}],"muhuka":[{"id":"muhuka","headword":"मुहुक","headword_slp1":"muhuka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"pos":"n.","spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"a moment, instant (˚कै॑स् ind. = prec.), RV."}]}]}],"muhukEs":[{"id":"muhukEs","headword":"मुहुकैस्","headword_slp1":"muhukEs","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","